			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 110020201,
					"content": "應該是在這個附近吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110020202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "香菱"
				},
				{
					"id": 110020202,
					"content": "已經想到要找什麼了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110020203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110020203,
					"content": "當然沒有！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110020204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "香菱"
				},
				{
					"id": 110020204,
					"content": "那為什麼會這麼理直氣壯啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110020205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110020205,
					"content": "這是我的風格嘛，如果在做一道菜之前就想好了要做什麼，那註定就是一份沒有驚喜的料理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110020206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "香菱"
				},
				{
					"id": 110020206,
					"content": "同樣，如果在找到之前就想好了要找什麼，那也是沒有驚喜的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110020207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "香菱"
				},
				{
					"id": 110020207,
					"content": "這也太豪邁了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110020208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110020208,
					"content": "放心吧，「萬民堂」的招牌菜都是這麼來的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110020209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "香菱"
				},
				{
					"id": 110020209,
					"content": "#先在周圍隨便看看吧，如果我看到喜歡的食材我會告訴{F#妳}{M#你}的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "香菱"
				}
			]
		},
		{
